window.products.push({"id":501005,"name":"Bright Zeal 30 Ft 60 LED Pumpkin String Lights Outdoor Waterproof Battery Operated String Lights Christmas Indoor - LED Outdoor Christmas Lights Timer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BkqxcqaZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"30 FEET 60 LED CHRISTMAS PUMPKIN STRING LIGHT 1. This 30 Feet battery operated pumpkin string light consists of TWO 15 Feet string lights, each lined up with 30 orange pumpkin globes (each globe containing 1 LED light inside), 60 LEDs and 60 pumpkins total.2. When powered on, each pumpkin globe emits orange LED glow and shows off a pumpkin - The silver color copper wire can be bent into any shape to satisfy any imagination.3. The REMOTE controls 8 lighting modes, 6hr timer, brightness - Make Your Christmas Outstanding. 8 LIGHTING MODES BY REMOTE OR MANUAL CONTROLLER 1. Set the lighting mode and the brightness by remote from EIGHT (8) popular options: Combination, In-wave, Sequential-on, Slo-glo, Chasing/Flash, Slow-fade, Twinkle/Flash, Steady-on.2. Bendable silver color copper wire and controllable lighting mode and brightness make indoor outdoor decoration possibilities endless, day & night.3. Take Your Christmas Light Show To The Next Level. WATERPROOF & 6HR TIMER 1. The silver color copper wire and the mini LED bulbs are waterproof for outdoor & indoor decorations.2. A 6/18 hours timer can be turned on by remote, allowing to set the light for an automatic glow every day at the same time.3. Ideal for events, holidays, bedroom, wedding, parties, shows, etc. ENERGY SAVING & EASY TO INSTALL 1. Long lasting LED bulbs stay cool to touch after long-time use. For a new set of batteries, the product lifespan is about 2-3 weeks with the timer on, long enough for the whole Christmas period.2. No wiring required, fast and easy to install. No more tangled mess of cords or searching for an outlet. ATTENTION 1. The unit has small parts. To prevent choking hazard, children under 3 years should not be allowed to use.2. DO NOT make too much twisting or the coating lacquer will fall off and the light will short circuit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BkqxcqaZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bright Zeal","source_asin":"B09N3KLLCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N3KLLCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N3KLLCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
