window.products.push({"id":501115,"name":"BLACK + BLUM Candle Holder, L 16.5cm W 10.5cm H 15 cm, Chromed Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413WKUEKbmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Black+Blum's Candle Holder with Finger Loop is inspired by the “Fibonacci Curve” that is seen throughout nature and looks balanced and in proportion to the human eye. Inspired by the quintessential finger held candle holder of the days gone, the finger loop is a stunning minimal interpretation. Inspired Balance Your candle holder is made from a piece of straight wire and bent by hand until its unique and dynamic shape is formed. Black+Blum Candle Holder Range Black+Blum have designed various Fibonacci Curve inspired candle holders, similar designs come in various finishes to suit your home and style preference. Candle Holder Specifications The finger loop is constructed out of chromed stainless steel for durability and sleek feel. Dimensions of the finger loop candlestick candle holder: L 16.5cm W 10.5cm H 15 cm / L 6.5\" W 4.1\" H 5.9\" Individually boxed. Easy Cleaning Dip in hot water to melt the wax and polish off with a dry soft cloth. Do not scrub as it may remove the chroming. Alternatively, put the candelabra in the freezer for a few hours which will enable you to break the hardened wax clean off. Ideal Dash of Character for Your Livingroom Finding a fully functional yet completely aesthetic product for your home can be difficult. Black+Blum's quirky homeware is designed to add a touch of elegance to your living room, dining room, kitchen or office. The perfect finishing touches and eye-catching accessories to truly express your designer taste. Black+Blum create designs that people love to use and are proud to own. Set Contains: Candle holder loop","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413WKUEKbmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLACK + BLUM","source_asin":"B00FFXAHF0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FFXAHF0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FFXAHF0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
