window.products.push({"id":501272,"name":"Ameriwood Home Ellsworth Fireplace with Mantel, Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":233.43,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+QqwQF6RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy the warm and inviting feel of a fire at the push of a button with Ameriwood Home Ellsworth Fireplace with Mantel. Adorn with your favorite décor or your beloved family photos atop the mantel and give your room a pleasant modern look with the deep espresso finish. Control the Fireplace flame setting with the included remote control or by the touch panel and choose to enjoy your Fireplace with or without the heat setting while still allowing the flames to give off their calming feel. This 23\" fireplace insert is powerful enough to warm a room up to 400 square feet and features an adjustable temperature control and adjustable flame to both create your desired ambiance while keeping your room at the perfect temperature. The Electric Fireplace ships flat to your door and requires assembly. Two adults are recommended to assemble and move. Once assembled, the Fireplace measures to be 31.89”H x 31.65”W x 7.76”D.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+QqwQF6RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ameriwood Home","source_asin":"B09NRLPM6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NRLPM6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NRLPM6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":501273,"name":"Tianmai 5.7\" Natural Obsidian Carved Realistic Crystal Skull Sculpture, Healing Energy Reiki Gemstone Collectible Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rguSwSSDL._AC_SL1334_.jpg","description":"Where does the crystal long skull come from? The inspiration of the crystal long skull comes from Paracas skull. Paracas is a desolate Islands on the south coast of Peru. In 1928, Julio Tello, a local archaeologist in Peru, found more than 300 slender skulls on the island, which had a history of about 3000 years. The skull is 25% larger than the traditional skull and 60% heavier than the skull. What is more amazing is that the mitochondrial DNA in parakas slender skull carries any unknown mutation that no primate has.It was because of such Paracas skull, like an alien life, that we created the long crystal skull. Each crystal skull figurine is the result of both our designers and workers! ★Manual polishing, polished smooth edges and corners. ★The craftsmanship of this skulls is superb. This makes them the perfect size for crystal healing and displaying. ★Each and every specimen is unique and you will receive one similar to the image shown. ★Each one is selected from the origin and superior material. Tips: 1. Be careful not to drop it down otherwise it would break into pieces. 2. Please don't touch it with other chemicals, they would damage your crystal. 3. Just wash it with clean water and soft cloth. 4. The actual item you get may not match the picture 100%. Please click our brand name which on the top of the title, you can find more crystal products with high quality and reasonable price.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rguSwSSDL._AC_SL1334_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tianmai","source_asin":"B071RXQ67W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071RXQ67W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071RXQ67W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
