window.products.push({"id":501285,"name":"Forschner 40711 Fillet 8-Inch Knife Stiff Blk Fibrox Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AHs0GWNoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The R. H. Forschner collection has grown in size and stature since its name was first carved in steel in 1855. Historically a premier choice of culinary professionals, it is still preferred by professionals today. Renowned for its extremely sharp, Swiss made, steel blades from Victorinox, R. H. Forschner provides professionals in food processing and preparation with superior quality, value-priced cutlery that enhances performance and increases productivity. R. H. Forschner's extensive series of fishing knives are utilized worldwide in the commercial fishing industry. Did You Know: Use a narrow boning knife on ribs and chops to cut easily through bone and cartilage. Use a wide boning knife for chicken and pork. Use a curved boning knife for a better working angle when cutting close to and around the bone. A Granton edge, or \"kullenschiff\" edge, has hollowed out grooves on the sides of the blade. These grooves fill with the fat and juices of the product being sliced, which allows for thin, even cuts without tearing or shredding the meat. **The NSF mark is a certification of quality assurance and hygienic design. The National Sanitation Foundation mark is proudly carried on all R. H. Forschner blades with a fibrox or nylon handle and assures you of quality and assurance to use in a commercial environment. Look for this mark. Realize that most manufacturers do not carry this seal!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AHs0GWNoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FORSCHNER","source_asin":"B000EZ0D4E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EZ0D4E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EZ0D4E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":501286,"name":"Calphalon Contemporary Nonstick 8\" Omelette with Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31M7605EJAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Perfect flips, and no flops! Calphalon’s Contemporary Nonstick omelette pans feature a thick, flat, wide bottom for quick, even heating and cooking with little to no oils. The gently sloping sides and nonstick surface allow the omelet to glide freely, flip in one quick motion and slide easily from the pan to your plate. Plus, cleanup is easy. The rolled stainless steel Cool Touch handle conducts heat more slowly than cast iron handles, so it stays cool on the stove top. It’s sure to bring out your sunny side. Amazon.com Calphalon refines the art of cooking omelets and sautéing vegetables with this 8-inch omelet pan. With its nonstick interior and gently sloped sides, the pan cradles your omelet--gliding it smoothly and easily across the skillet's surface. When finished, slide the omelet from pan to plate without reaching for the spatula. The pan's thick, wide bottom conducts heat beautifully, creating omelets cooked to a perfect consistency. Calphalon's Contemporary Nonstick cookware features a hard-anodized exterior for durability and heat retention and a nonstick interior. The nonstick coating makes cleanup a breeze. The pan also includes a matte-finish handle that stays cool on the stovetop, while its slip-resistant grip ensures the pan won't fall from your hand if slightly wet. Topping off the skillet is a glass-and-stainless cover that lets you view your food while cooking--a great touch when simmering stews, heating sauces, or sautéing meats. Contemporary Nonstick cookware is oven-safe to 450 degrees F, and hand washing is recommended. The cookware comes with a lifetime warranty. --Rivers Janssen From the Manufacturer Get together with Calphalon Contemporary Nonstick. Sharing great food with friends and family is surely one of life's most delicious pleasures. And Calphalon Contemporary Nonstick makes it so easy to get together! Designed to fit your style of cooking, living and entertaining, Contemporary Nonstick features an exclusive nonstick interior, formulated for durability and effortless clean-up. (Our nonstick coating makes preparing healthy, low-fat meals a snap, too.) Constructed from heavy-gauge hard-anodized aluminum, Contemporary Nonstick cookware heats evenly, sears quickly and browns foods beautifully--and it's guaranteed to last a lifetime. Even a quick glance at Calphalon Contemporary Nonstick tells you, there's something exciting happening in the Calphalon Kitchen. You notice it in the cookware's gracefully curved vessels . . . in its elegantly arched, subtly polished handles and sparkling glass-and-stainless covers. We designed Contemporary Nonstick so you wouldn't dream of hiding it in the kitchen--you'll want to bring it right to the table. The Pot Lucky pan is just right for casseroles, risotto, mashed potatoes and more. Contemporary Nonstick's full-capacity line helps prevent over-filling and simplifies serving! Contemporary Nonstick cookware is designed for versatility. Vessels are shaped to accommodate several different techniques. Many feature two loop handles, to easily allow for both stovetop and oven cooking. (All Contemporary Nonstick pans are oven-safe to 450 degrees.) They're also perfect for serving--whether in the kitchen, dining room, living room or den. The Entertainer is a perfect example: it sautés, braises, or bakes with equal finesse! Contemporary Nonstick's stay-cool long handles make stovetop cooking more comfortable and convenient. Making omelettes to order is no problem--your Daily Sizzle pan's handle will stay cool no matter how many you have to flip! Pancakes, French toast, toast, and eggs over-easy all slide effortlessly from atop your Morning Glory pan. And clean-up takes no time at all, thanks to an exclusive Calphalon nonstick coating. The Morning Glory is also ideal for grilled sandwiches and veggie burgers. Don't make brunch--or lunch--without it! Some things can't be rushed. Pot roast, for example. And your Mama's marinara. From braised beef to simmering soups, Contemporary Nonstick cookware is the perfect choice for slow-cooking. Constructed from heavy-gauge hard-anodized aluminum, it heats gently and evenly--allowing spices to meld and mellow and meats to turn \"fork tender\"--without sticking or scorching. There are times when you barely have a minute to toss together soup and a sandwich. \"Heat-and-eat\" is the order of day. That's why Contemporary Nonstick includes pans of all shapes and sizes--for every day as well as entertaining. Your Short and Saucy pan is perfect for warming soups and sauces, cooking vegetables and much more. Contemporary Nonstick features: Hard-anodized exterior--nonstick techniques interior for easy clean up and the ability to cook with healthier ingredients and techniques Hard-anodized exterior--nonstick techniques interior for easy clean up and the ability to cook with healthier ingredients and techniques Nonstick is oven safe to 450 degrees Nonstick is oven safe to 450 degrees Flared for access--wider at","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31M7605EJAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B0000936JI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000936JI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000936JI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
