window.products.push({"id":501316,"name":"The Hamilton Collection Coca-Cola Elegant Woman Figurine: an Elegant Tradition of Love","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X1vle59cL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"In days past, Victorian women used their fans to send unspoken messages to suitors, perhaps even at the soda fountain over a bubbling glass of Coca-Cola®. Now, for the first time ever, this officially licensed Coca-Cola elegant woman figurine celebrates those time-honored traditions or romance and the eternal language of love with refreshing style.A Hamilton Collection exclusive and fashioned after the popular Coca-Cola Girls of the early 1900s, this limited-edition figurine is handcrafted in artist's resin and hand-painted to bring out intricate lifelike detail. She wears a stunning red Victorian-style gown embellished with etched black detailing that has the look of fine embroidery. Her wide-brimmed hat is decorated with sculptural flowers, bows, and a real feather. In one delicately gloved hand she holds a glass of Coca-Cola; in the other she positions her fan of real feathers to send a secret message to her gentleman friend. Strong demand is expected among collectors who appreciate fine Coca-Cola collectibles, so order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X1vle59cL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Hamilton Collection","source_asin":"B007IMOTG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007IMOTG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007IMOTG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
