window.products.push({"id":501378,"name":"100% Cotton Body Pillow Cover I Long Sham Zippered Pregnancy Maternity Body Pillowcase | Premium Quality Cotton Cover Only (Charcoal Grey, 14 x36 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UE7TB1T4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️FEATURES: Includes 1 piece of rectangular solid colored body pillow case. Pillow insert is NOT included. ✔️QUALITY: Crafted from high-quality durable woven fabric that holds up well for long term use. The cotton fabric has been brushed to create soft texture and pre-washed to prevent shrinking. This breathable fabric subscribes a level of comfort and reliability. ✔️DESIGN: Finished with a premium hidden zipper closure on the bottom for easy removal of large insert. The seams are double stitched for durability. Inside seams are finished to prevent fraying and stress points are reinforced. Solid color is easy to pair with almost any decor. ✔️MULTI PURPOSE: Big and full bolster pillow is perfect for snuggling and cozy night's sleep both for adults and kids. It gives ideal support for side, stomach and pregnant sleepers. It is also a wonderful decorative addition to your bedroom, sofa, couch, and bench. ✔️EASY TO CLEAN: Machine washable in cold water. Gentle Cycle with like colors. We recommend air drying to best preserve fibers, color and elasticity. If using a dryer, tumble dry low. No Bleach. Keep the zipper closed while washing and drying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UE7TB1T4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silver Fern Decor","source_asin":"B087T6N1HY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087T6N1HY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087T6N1HY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":501379,"name":"Boho Kitchen Rug 2'x3' Small Bathroom Rug with Tassels,White Cotton Moroccan Farmhouse Bath Mat Woven Cute Geometric Throw Rug Washable for Entry Hall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dOuS4ZbOS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"When it comes to home decor, there’s nothing quite like a unique bohemian rug to make a bold statement. Or a more subtle one, if you prefer the boho kitchen sink rug isone of the best ways to bring a bedroom, living room, or even dining room space together and make your interior design shine.If you’re intrigued by the ideaof adding a touch of boho to your home,a moroccan rug is a great way to add color and style to a room. Yarn-dyed Process Style Your Room:This collection includes contemporary Yarn-dyed designs & trendy boho themes for in- & even outdoor use. White woven rug with blackyarn geometric pattern.Black woven rug with white yarn geometric pattern.small plush yarn tufted woven on the boho runner rug adds exquisite detail and craftsmanship.High-quality workmanship, the fabric is thick, durably designed for long-lasting life. Don’t worry, the yarn tufts are hand-woven and won’t fall off at will. Theindoor outdoor rug will not deform and fade easily PRODUCTS DESCRIPTION Fabric:45 Percent cotton +45 Percent polyester +10 Percent viscose pets and kids Friendly, Technics:Hand Knotted, Handmade, Woven Size:2'x3', 2'x4.3',2.3'x5.3',3'x5', 4'x6',5x7ft Usage:kitchen,guest bathroom,guest bedroom,front door entryway,fireplace,sink,hallway, under counter stools,in front of the tub,entrance,living room,laundry,patio,dining room,entrance,porch.. Washing instruction: Machine wash the small rug in a mesh bag with gentle water,do not bleach.Lay flat to dry. Hand wash can extend usage time Tips 1:Size excludes the tassel: 2'x3', 2'x4.3',2.3'x5.3' feet.Each side tassel is about 3.1 - 3.9 inches Size not exclude the tassel:3'x5', 4'x6',5x7feet. TIP 2:The back of the black and white bathroom rug without non-slip bottom,highly recommend match with slip grip for the bottom Tips 3:you can sit on your front porch under a welcome mat for a layered effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dOuS4ZbOS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uyi Grip","source_asin":"B092MRMS28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501379","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092MRMS28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092MRMS28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
