window.products.push({"id":501433,"name":"Onzhvex Llama Alpaca Backpack Set for Teen Girls Boys, Book Bag with Lunch Bag, Lightweight Lunch Box Set for Work, Travel, 2 Pcs Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RW1Bgq8gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Practical in life: The pack sets come with 1 backpack and 1 lunch bag. Backpack size: 12.2x16.7x5.3in, the perfect backpack have enough storage for all of your daily essentials like computer, phones, textbooks, A4 files, keys and cards. The overall size of insulated lunch bag is 10x8.9x6.5in, it could perfectly fits for your drinks, snacks, fruits. Premium Material for Packs: Our bag sets are made of durable polyester material. It has a quality of waterproof and resistance to wrinkles and creasing. The lunch bag is designed with an insulating lining to keep your lunch warm for about 4 hours. Sturdy seam-lines provide super load bearing, and the reusable easy-care fabric extends the life of our delicate sets. Versatile Sorting Compartment: One main compartment, one front pocket, two side pockets which can provide roomy capacity for your textbooks, stationery, clothes and more your daily necessities. Roomy capacity of the lunch bag could perfectly fits for your drinks, snacks, fruits. Large enough to carry daily meal or food for picnic, travel, work, beach. Comfortable Back Panel&Adjustable Shoulder Strap: Our backpacks come with adjustable padded shoulder straps, breathable back pads. Sponge Pad Design can reduce the pressure of your back and shoulder, breathable and comfortable. Adjustable shoulder strap or hand strap, choose the one that is most convenient for you and your favorite way. It is convenient to wear even when you have to carry around heavy loads for long time. Go Back to School: With a reliable backpack, you do not have to worry about fatigued arm or shoulder strain. Whether your little one is going to school, travel, camping, hiking, sports, party or other outdoor activities in daily life, this backpack set works perfect. Functional backpack set tailored to the need of any occasion, it is a good helper for you to organize your items or foods when you are going out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RW1Bgq8gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Onzhvex","source_asin":"B0B48M461R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501433","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B48M461R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B48M461R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":501434,"name":"HERAKLIA Turkish Beach Towel -100% Cotton - 38 x 71 Inches - Prewashed for Soft Feel - Quick Dry Sand Free Lightweight Bath Towels Oversized - Turkish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NE0EWqjsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY TO PACK AND CARRY: Our lightweight, compact and incredibly soft Turkish towel is thinner than traditional terrycloth but just as absorbent after your shower or bath; It comfortably fits in your bag or closet, making it convenient for pool, weekend getaway, gym, travel, backpacking while an ideal as picnic blanket, yoga blanket or beach accessories. If you’re planning on taking a trip to the beach or pool, you’re going to need our beach towels oversized to keep you dry. QUICK DRY TOWEL WITH OPTIMAL THICKNESS: Not thick or overly plush so that it dries quicker than the plusher ones, our pool towels wick moisture away preventing unpleasant and lasting smell; Not extremely thin, Heraklia Turkish beach towels give the supreme comfort and warmth pampering your skin. QUALITY THAT MAKES THE DIFFERENCE: We are proud of the texture of our non-stiff extra large bathroom towels; At Heraklia, the premium cotton fabric is prewashed for minimal shrinkage and cloud-like softness, making this lightweight beach towel superior to classic beach towels; Made in Turkey, it is impressively durable yet exceptionally smooth,not scratchy with OEKO-TEX certified natural yarn. SAND FREE BEACH TOWEL: No more sandy beach towel, so shake off sand-free Heraklia Turkish peshtamal, and you have no sand left in your bag; Great to use it as a hair towel wrap, cover up,shawl, and beach accessory, our stylish, attention-grabbing peshtemal towel stays wrapped around you easily whenever,wherever you need it. HOME GIFT IDEA: To keep your loved ones comfy, dry and warm is the best gift ever; This exclusive large beach blanket makes an ideal gift for man and woman for any occasion from birthdays and anniversaries to house warming and Christmas, adding style and oriental beauty to any decor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NE0EWqjsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HERAKLIA TURKISH COTTON","source_asin":"B0992WL8V8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0992WL8V8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0992WL8V8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
