window.products.push({"id":501552,"name":"iappadore Metal Towel Racks with 6 Hooks, 2-Pack Self-Mounted, Adhesive Towel Bar, Bathroom Hanger, 12'' and 18'', Re-Mountable Holder for Kitchen Clo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QzecmMfRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SELF-ADHESIVE: Easy-to-mount! Peel the protective backings off and stick the rack in the desired location. Then slide the rack off and squeeze any bubbles out of the adhesive for an even stronger adhesion. Works best on smooth surfaces, but will work on wallpaper and painted walls (but not ideal). Recommend waiting 12 hours before hanging anything NO DAMAGE from drills or holes. And should you wish to remove the rack, simply slide the rack off and heat the adhesive with a hair-dryer; the adhesive will become easy to remove with zero damage RE-USABLE! After removal, wash the adhesive by rinsing with water; when it dries, it’ll be ready for re-use. Hang towels from the bar, and brushes, loofahs, and more from the 3 built-in hooks QUALITY MATERIALS: each rust-proof metal rod is equipped with 3 built-in hooks (that can slide across the bar) and is supported by two attractive rubber ends. The larger 18.5-inch rack weighs less than half a pound (7.6 oz) – half the weight of comparable all-metal racks. The smaller 12-inch rack weighs just 6 ounces VERSATILE: the water-resistant, re-usable adhesive provides far better adhesion than suction cups, and can be used virtually anywhere. Suitable for the bathroom, kitchen, shower, closet, bedroom – you could even mount one on the laundry room ceiling for hanging clothes that don’t go in the dryer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QzecmMfRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iappadore","source_asin":"B092T62RRM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092T62RRM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092T62RRM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
