window.products.push({"id":501749,"name":"Wooden Spurtle Kitchen Tools Set, Bawuie Natural Beech Wood Cooking Utensils Set for Kitchen, Durable Non-stick Wood Cookware with Hanging Loop, Slott","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6154LkMVWTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Bawuie Spurtle are uniquely-designed for for stirring, sifting, whisking, straining, separating eggs, spreading peanut or butter, smashing food, serving. Features: ▷Made of 100% Natural Beech Wood ▷Hangable ▷Ergonomic Handle Design ▷Easy to Clean ▷Scratch-Proof Material: Natural Beech wood What You Get: Original Spurtle x 1, Slotted Spurtle x 1, Medium Spurtle x 1, Skinny Spurtle x 1, 1. Wash the wooden spurtle set before first use 2. Hand wash is recommended","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6154LkMVWTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bawuie","source_asin":"B08TX51W66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TX51W66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TX51W66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":501750,"name":"Manual Woodworkers & Weavers Tapestry Throw Pillow, Flame Bright, 20\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.43,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IDbieg5xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the mountains of North Carolina, manual WW weaves, sews, prints, and develops not just the fabrics, textiles, and beautiful products you'd expect from a Heritage company, they bring you the freshest designs for your home. Although Thomas Lemuel Oates started manual Woodworkers & Weavers in 1932, the story goes back further. The roots of the company can be found in Oates' entrepreneurial spirit. He and his brother used to farm the Mountain areas of Bat cave in Western North Carolina. They would also help their mother find materials for her crafts. The sons began to make wooden whistles, buckets and bird-houses. They would sell their wares along with her crafts to the people from Charlotte that came through in their horse-drawn buggies on the way to the mountains. Later, Thomas worked at the Ashville postcard company. When the depression hit, he lost his job, but it inspired him to go into business and sell crafts, like cornhusk dolls and woven pieces, that were produced by the local women. He had learned about the Wholesale business while working at Ashville. He built a waterwheel to generate electricity at a mill, began making product and opened shop. Over the years, he expanded the company. His son, Lemuel Oates, who would next manage the company, says he worked in the business from a young age. He explains the products were made from cotton scraps left over from making socks. Half-inch circles would be looped together to form a variety of products. Lemuel Oates went to college and then settled in Richmond. In December 1973, he returned to Bat cave and took over the company. In 2007 his son Travis and his daughter, Molly Oates Sherrill, took over the business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IDbieg5xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MWW","source_asin":"B01IDHXZVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IDHXZVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IDHXZVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":501751,"name":"Christmas Advent Calendar Bags 2020,24 Days Burlap DIY Advent Calendar Bags for Filling,Xmas Countdown Candy Gifts Toys Fill Linen Bags, Christmas Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rT+8jNJcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎅 【Christmas Essentials Decor Bags】 The countdown advent calendar bag kit for Christmas contains 24 burlap drawstring bags, 10 m long with hemp rope, 24-piece wooden clips and number stickers, which you can use to decorate these bags and hang them up better. Great for hanging on the wall / fireplace. Perfect addition to your holiday decorations, simple decorations can add to the Christmas atmosphere. 🎅 【Durable And Reusable Count Down Bags】 Our 24 days burlap hanging advent calendars made of high-quality linen that has an excellent feel and is not as rough and scratchy as normal jute cloth. Each bag measures 4 x 5.5 inches. Finely processed. Artisanal and environmentally friendly material ensures that this calendar can be used year after year. 🎅 【Christmas Countdown Decorations】 Our 24 PCS linen advent calendars bags contain 12 different patterns, with 24 number stickers that can be easily disassembled and stuck on the bag. Kids can easily count to Christmas by putting candy or gifts in their bags every day and adding a cozy, homely feel to your Christmas vacation. 🎅 【Holiday Design Advent Calendar Bag】 Sophisticated and unique design. This cute Christmas countdown bags features a variety of classic Christmas elements like five-pointed stars, hanging moose, balls, bells, snowflakes, Christmas stockings, Christmas trees and Santa Claus. Red and colored patterns enhance the festive mood and are perfect for Christmas decorations. 🎅 【Multifunctional Gift Bag】 Our 24-piece Christmas countdown bags have different patterns for Christmas theme, can create a festival atmosphere, you can put some gifts, candy or other small items in each bag and open it by Christmas Day, memorable and meaningful.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rT+8jNJcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Juanssifer","source_asin":"B08JHBCH46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JHBCH46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JHBCH46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
