window.products.push({"id":501780,"name":"SLPR Set of 3 Rustic White Wooden Crates for Display with Rope Handles: Wood Crate Boxes for Storage and Decoration, Vintage Farmhouse Distressed Déco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1UWHcHTN+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLISH STORAGE WITH RUSTIC APPEAL: Store in style with our set of 3 rustic white wooden crates. These decorative wooden boxes are perfect for holding oils, cooking utensils, canned goods, towels, or toiletries. Their distressed, white-washed design makes them great for adding vintage farmhouse charm to your kitchen, pantry, bathroom, laundry room, office, or craft room. OPEN PALLETTE-STYLE CRATES FOR EASY ACCESS: Our farmhouse wooden boxes are designed with open slats and an open top to give you quick and easy access to your items. They're ideal for clearing clutter in busy entryways, holding shoes, hats, toys, or even tennis balls for your pet. Their open design makes it easy to identify the crate’s contents at a glance. VERSATILE DECORATIVE CRATES: Perfect for floral arrangements, wedding decor, crafts, and more, these rustic storage bins are an elegant addition to any space. Showcase your arts and crafts at a fair, create a gorgeous wooden display stand for a country chic wedding, or use them as small office storage. The vintage crate look is perfect for adding a rustic touch to any event or decor theme. ROPE HANDLES FOR EASY PORTABILITY: Each of our wood storage crates features a distressed look with unique rope handles. Not only do these handles add an authentic farmhouse vibe, they also make it easy to move the crates around for storage and transportation. These crates offer a touch of nautical charm to your rustic decor. THREE SIZES FOR YOUR STORAGE NEEDS: Our wooden crates come in three sizes to accommodate your specific storage needs. Each set of 3 contains one of each size; Small: 10.2\" x 6.3\" x 5.5\", Medium: 12.2\" x 8.2\" x 6.3\", Large: 14.2\" x 10.2\" x 7\". These sizes make our crates versatile storage solutions, perfect for keeping you organized while adding a touch of rustic charm to your space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1UWHcHTN+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SLPR","source_asin":"B0C5SBNKPN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5SBNKPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5SBNKPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
