window.products.push({"id":501791,"name":"MUXX.STIL Office Chair, Desk Chair with Adjustable Lumbar Support, Ergonomic Task Chair with Breathable Mesh, Swivel Computer Chair with Flip-up Armre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rBt7Yw9fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Enhanced Lumbar Support】This office chair features a large and adjustable lumbar support cushion filled with thick sponge to cradle your lower back and help you maintain a comfortable posture for long hours of work. It also has an S-shaped ergonomic backrest that aligns with your spine and reduces pressure and muscle fatigue. 【Space Saving】The armrests of this desk chair can be flipped up 90° to fit different needs and save space. You can slide the chair under the desk when not in use. The armrests are contoured to match your arms’ shape and have soft padding to protect your wrists and elbows. The computer chair can be adjusted in height by 3.74 inches and swivel 360° for convenience. 【Versatile Use】The rubber mute wheels of this mesh chair roll smoothly and quietly without scratching your wooden floor. You can also recline the chair by pulling out the lever and enjoy a relaxing break from work. This chair is suitable for various settings, such as office, living room, study room, meeting room, etc. 【Comfortable & Safe】Muxx.Stil ergonomic office chair has a U-shaped seat cushion filled with high-density foam that conforms to your body and relieves pressure on your thighs and hips. The seat also has a waterfall edge design that promotes blood circulation in your legs. The breathable nylon mesh material allows air circulation and keeps you cool all day long. Max capacity: 264 lbs. 【Easy To Assemble & 2-year Warranty】You can easily set up this mesh chair in 15-20 minutes with the provided instruction manual, video, and tools. All task chairs come with a 2-year warranty, so please feel free to contact us if you have any questions or issues. We will provide you with effective assistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rBt7Yw9fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUXX.STIL","source_asin":"B0BX2WK1HR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX2WK1HR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX2WK1HR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":501792,"name":"GKLUCKIN Shag Ultra Soft Area Rug, Fluffy 2'X3' Tie-Dyed Pink&Purple Fuzzy Foyer Rug for Entryway Non-Skid Small Furry Plush Accent Rugs for Living Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1gj9ZXI8CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ultra-Soft Designed】The GKLUCKIN area rug comes with a velvet feeling surface and a dense sponge layer in the middle that provides high-level coziness as it is very soft to the touch. It's ideal to keep your feet warm from cold hardwood floors or for your kids to lie on it comfortably while playing. Also, a great gift for your family, friends, or lovers at Christmas. 【Higher Density Faux Fur】Feature 1.57-inch-long pile, 450 GSM High-density shag carpet surface, the GKLUCKIN fluffy area rug is incredibly plush and furry. Hardly sheds carpet fibers! This fuzzy area rug provides a rest space for your family to release their body and mind after a busy day. Perfect to decor your rooms. 【Anti-slip bottom】Tiny, durable grip dots on the underside of the area rug are designed to hold up without sliding, even with kids and pets. Plus, it helps to soothe achy muscles and tired feet! The middle foam layer of the rug adds extra cushion under your feet and will redefine your definition of comfort! Ideal for living rooms, bedrooms, nursery, hallway, dorm, etc., without damaging the floor. 【Eco-friendly Materials】Have peace of mind knowing that even in high-trafficked areas of your home, your GKLUCKIN area rug was designed to last for years to come! This extremely soft velvet carpet is made from synthetic material(polyester), and the hypoallergenic property of this area rug makes it perfect for people with sensitive skin or allergies. You can feel free to lay on the carpet areas, barefoot walking, and good for leisure time. Friendly for kids and pets! 【Easy Care】We recommend to vacuum the rug regularly to reduce potential sheds and dust, or you can hand wash the dirty area without worrying about color fade. Since the carpet is covered with a lot of long pile, it's essential to know in advance how fragile it is when you put it in the washing machine. So we don't recommend you do this.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1gj9ZXI8CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GKLUCKIN","source_asin":"B08QGSXQ13","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QGSXQ13","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QGSXQ13","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
