window.products.push({"id":501862,"name":"Besmon Olive Oil Sprayer Food-grade Glass Bottle dispenser for Cooking, BBQ, Salad, Kitchen Baking, Roasting, Frying (Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zJZ+y6JaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"See how the cooking oil sprayer dispenser help your working in the kitchen. 1. Save your money:New spray nozzles sprays finer and more even, It cover the food great and won’t leave excess oil to be wasted. 2. Save your time: No pumping! Just press the botton and it will spray perfect mist. Say goodbye to the old pumping sprayer and the cooking brush. 3. Make you a professional chef: Our oil sprayer bottle can keep your hands from getting oily, and the sleek design makes it look nice and classy on your counter. Material: Glass and stainless steel Dimensions: 17.5 x 4 x 4cm / 6.9 x 1.6 x 1.6in Capacity: 100ml Weight: 9.9oz Specification: The oil sprayer bottle is made from transparent glass, you can distinguish the seasoning (oil/vinegar) and remaining measure quickly. It's also a healthy way to manage calories. Perfect for low-fat cooking, grilling, saute, roasting and barbecue. The cap with stripes design prevent effective slipping. How to clean: 1.Fill bottle with hot water and add one drop of liquid detergent. 2.Shake it 6-8times, then spray into the sink. 3.Refill with clean water, repeat step 2 and wash inner side with a brush. 4.Re-tighten the cap and store at room temperature until next use. 5.It is recommended to clean your Cooking Oil Sprayer every 6-8 weeks. Instructions: 1.For the first use, please press the button several times.After that, no additional pumping to build pressure. 2.To ensure a fine mist, don't fill it too much oil(best below half way) and press the button forcefully all the way down. 3.As the oil is easy to solidify(especially winter), It may clogged the tip, cause the sprayer spray a stream. Just run the nozzle under warm water for a few seconds, It will return to normal. Packaged Include: 1 x oil sprayer dispenser","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zJZ+y6JaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Besmon","source_asin":"B07ZJHHB7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZJHHB7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZJHHB7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
