window.products.push({"id":501913,"name":"BAOSUMEI Home Decor Modern Statue Sculpture 5.9’’ Decorative Plate，Plates Bas-Relief Sculpture Object with Stand,The Angle’s Mother and Son Statue Tra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hL5Tib7TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Grace Your Space] This elegant plaster bas-relief decorative plate captures the intricate details and will be a highlight in a room and add just the right vibe. It is ideal for display in a hall, bedroom, office, or any other space. Plaster bas-relief plate diameter: 5.9 inches. [Grace Your Space] This elegant plaster bas-relief decorative plate captures the intricate details and will be a highlight in a room and add just the right vibe. It is ideal for display in a hall, bedroom, office, or any other space. Plaster bas-relief plate diameter: 5.9 inches. [Create a Fancy Photo Wall] This pure white plaster decorative statue complements any interior style. In addition to displaying it on a stand, you can match the sculpture plates to your frames on the wall to create a fancy and artistic photo wall. Hanging hardware is not included. [Extra Uses] This home decor can also serve as a scent diffuser. Spray your favorite perfume on the sculpture, and it will keep the room smelling great for days. Also, it also functions as a lovely storage tray for your jewelry, cosmetics, or other small items, etc. [Light and Energy] The tabletop Virgin Mary statue tray symbolizes light and energy, perfect for everyday, event or aromatherapy use. It is also a wonderful gift for birthdays, weddings, Mother’s Day, Christmas, New Year, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hL5Tib7TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAOSUMEI","source_asin":"B09PVKCS44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501913","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PVKCS44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PVKCS44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":501914,"name":"Green Aventurine Merkaba Star (3/4\" - 1-1/4\") - 1pc.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uZ1CQn0GL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These Green Aventurine Merkaba (Merkabah) Stars are mined in Northern India and hand-cut by stone cutters there. In ancient Egypt, the literal translation of Merkaba is broken down by syllable to mean Mer-rotating fields of light, Ka-spirit, and Ba-soul. One of the Sacred Geometry forms, The Merkaba is believed to achieve transformation on all levels of existence. In Hebrew, Merkaba literally means \"Chariot\". The Merkaba literally becomes a vehicle for ascension. Merkabas are tetrahedrons, made by the intersection of two, three-sided pyramids. The Merkaba is the geometric shape of the human energy field (or aura) and it is good for spiritual transformation as well as helping to connect with our Higher Selves. These shapes are believed to form a spiritual shield around the holder and are very useful for healing the chakras and during meditation. These Merkabas are enhanced by contributing the helpful energies of Green Aventurine. These Green Aventurine Merkabas may help to clear, activate and strengthen the Heart Chakra, allowing one to feel the universal force of love that connects everything. Green Aventurine comforts, harmonizes, and protects the heart, and can help attract love later in life. Green Aventurine is good for working with the Heart Chakra and with the Water Elements. Green Aventurine is known as the good luck stone and is often used in rituals with green candles, or kept in cash boxes or drawers to attract money. Many people love to combine the expansive energy of Green Aventurine with the prosperous energy of Citrine when they want to work on increasing their abundance opportunities. Green Aventurine has a particularly soothing energy behind it, and is recommended for working through unresolved emotional issues. Physically, Green Aventurine is said to be an all around healing stone with * Pictures represent variation in color quality.  Please see product name for the actual quantity for this item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uZ1CQn0GL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Healing Crystals","source_asin":"B00475XQ8W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-501914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00475XQ8W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00475XQ8W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
